x; color: var(--wh-primary); margin-bottom: 20px;\">Webhosting NZ Design</div>\n            <h1>Clean websites that <span class=\"gradient-text\">actually sell.</span></h1>\n            <p>We build premium, mobile-first WordPress websites for New Zealand businesses. Fast loading, SEO optimized, and designed to turn visitors into loyal customers.</p>\n            <div class=\"btn-wrapper\">\n                <a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"wh-btn wh-btn-primary\">View Packages</a>\n                <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"wh-btn wh-btn-outline\">Get a Quote</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-visual\">\n            <div class=\"browser-card\">\n                <div class=\"browser-header\">\n                    <div class=\"dot r\"></div><div class=\"dot y\"></div><div class=\"dot g\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"browser-body\">\n                    <div class=\"skel h\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"skel t\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"skel t\"></div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: auto; display:flex; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <div class=\"skel b\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"features\">\n        <h2>Why we're <span class=\"gradient-text\">different</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"subtitle\">Forget clunky templates. We build for speed and performance.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"features-grid\">\n            <div class=\"feature-card scroll-trigger\">\n                <div class=\"icon-box\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"></path></svg></div>\n                <h3>Blazing Fast</h3>\n                <p>Google loves fast sites. We optimize every line of code to ensure your site loads in under 2 seconds.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-card scroll-trigger\" style=\"transition-delay: 100ms\">\n                <div class=\"icon-box\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"2\" width=\"14\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></div>\n                <h3>Mobile First</h3>\n                <p>Over 60% of traffic is mobile. We design for the smallest screens first, ensuring a perfect experience everywhere.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-card scroll-trigger\" style=\"transition-delay: 200ms\">\n                <div class=\"icon-box\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"></path></svg></div>\n                <h3>SEO Built-in</h3>\n                <p>We build with clean structure, proper tags, and schema markup so you rank higher from day one.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h2>Our <span class=\"gradient-text\">Process</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"subtitle\">A simple, transparent path to your new website.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"process-line-container\">\n            <div class=\"step-item step-trigger\">\n                <div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n                <h3>Discovery & Strategy</h3>\n                <p>We sit down (virtually) to understand your business goals, target audience, and competitors. No guesswork.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"step-item step-trigger\">\n                <div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n                <h3>Visual Design</h3>\n                <p>We craft a custom mockup. You get to see exactly what your site will look like before we write a single line of code.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"step-item step-trigger\">\n                <div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n                <h3>Development</h3>\n                <p>We build your site on WordPress using clean, lightweight code. We set up security, analytics, and speed optimization.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"step-item step-trigger\">\n                <div class=\"step-number\">4</div>\n                <h3>Launch & Train</h3>\n                <p>We push the live button! Then we send you a video tutorial showing you exactly how to edit your own content.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"pricing\">\n        <h2>Simple <span class=\"gradient-text\">Pricing</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"subtitle\">No hidden fees. Just clear value.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"pricing-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"price-card scroll-trigger\">\n                <h3>Starter</h3>\n                <div class=\"price\">$119<span> NZD</span></div>\n                <p style=\"color: #64748b; margin-top: 10px;\">For new businesses.</p>\n                <ul class=\"checks\">\n                    <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> 3 Custom Pages</li>\n                    <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Mobile Responsive</li>\n                    <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Basic SEO</li>\n                </ul>\n                <a href=\"/checkout/?add-to-cart=4454\" class=\"wh-btn wh-btn-outline\" style=\"width:100%\">Choose Starter</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"price-card popular scroll-trigger\" style=\"transition-delay: 100ms\">\n                <div class=\"badge\">Most P